    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.022
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - '<SFX_tour_guide_chuckle>Haha, <b><i>Senator Mahalia Lapuz</i></b> got into
      a real big controversy because she was cracking down on illegal gambling rings... '
    - Only to get exposed for hosting chicken fighting gambling parties.
    - "<SFX_tour_guide_concerned>Still, I can\u2019t disparage her reputation too
      much, she was the one who first had the museum built, after all."
