    font: {fileID: 0}
    textSpeed: 0.024
    textPunctSpeed: 0.18
    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - "<SFX_rommel_concerned>That is too much for your standing. I am talking about
      a <i>private</i> meeting\u2014more confidential than what we are having as
      of the moment. "
    - "Only the Disidensiya leaders are participating as their opinions and plans
      about the current situation of our country contribute to my proposition. \r\n"
    - Their approval is most important to new possible arrangements.
