      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9041903786073183966, guid: 09fbf670f6b1442b3895d0264e1b949c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: <SFX_liezel_questioning><i>(A sack? If it is attached to the other components
        of the town bell, then it may be used to ring the bell. It is currently empty
        since there are no reasons to use this bell as of the moment.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9041903786073183966, guid: 09fbf670f6b1442b3895d0264e1b949c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <SFX_liezel_thinking><i>(According to what I have read and heard before,
        there is a specific process to follow to ring the town bell. Unfortunately,
        I only know how to accomplish this and do not have what is needed for it.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9041903786073183966, guid: 09fbf670f6b1442b3895d0264e1b949c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: <i>(I need to gather what is needed before I can use it.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 9041903786073183966, guid: 09fbf670f6b1442b3895d0264e1b949c, type: 3}
      propertyPath: playeritemNamesToRemove.Array.size
