    lettersUntilSFX: 3
    sentences:
    - <SFX_liezel_relieved><i>(There. The bell is ringing correctly. It should be
      able to capture the attention of many now.)</i>
    - "<i>(Once they come, I must take the small chance to enter Rommel\u2019s House
      unguarded.)</i>"
    - <i>(This interference may gain me dishonor and judgement, but no amount of
      that would compare to the respect that Giyala needs.)</i>
    - "<SFX_liezel_concerned><i>(I sincerely hope that if not most, then one of our
      leaders will think this through. Servillano\u2026 you may be our last hope.)</i>"
